{"id":"n87330-1-10","stage":2,"title":"확대 · 扩大","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87330-1-10-1","ko":"이 사진은 가족들이 모두 잘 나왔네.","zh":"这张照片里全家人都拍得很好呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"사진은","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진은","audio":"/audio/727899a8ceefd98d868c.mp3"}},{"text":"가족들이","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들이","audio":"/audio/d69dfb967fbafe5f6083.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好看地，漂亮地","explanation":"잘：好看地，漂亮地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"10","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔네.","meaning":"出现，出来","explanation":"나오다：出现，出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"10","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔네","audio":"/audio/76f0230d7de435325f5d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好看地，漂亮地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常帅气而美丽地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"某个东西被发现或显现。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d2f1ed2faaf3254ff83.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87330-1-10-2","ko":"그럼 크게 확대를 해서 거실에 걸어 놓자.","zh":"那我们就把照片放大，挂在客厅里吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，极其","explanation":"크다：大，极其；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"15","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e3.mp3"}},{"text":"확대를","meaning":"扩大，放大，拓宽，扩充","explanation":"확대：扩大，放大，拓宽，扩充；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"확대","audio":"/audio/11c2e8e755e47360b4ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87330","senseId":"1","lemma":"확대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확대를","audio":"/audio/7a5d471ce39446087124.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"거실에","meaning":"客厅","explanation":"거실：客厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"거실","audio":"/audio/f75d2664aecb37c813ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66304","senseId":"1","lemma":"거실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거실에","audio":"/audio/6530196daa110a07d9aa.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어","meaning":"挂","explanation":"걸다：挂；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어","audio":"/audio/55801633d067934e827a.mp3"}},{"text":"놓자.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓자","audio":"/audio/3ff2e8f6250ca7ecd621.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，极其","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"表示“相当”、“非常”，“很”。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"11c2e8e755e47360","term":"확대","zh":"扩大，放大，拓宽，扩充","audio":"/audio/11c2e8e755e47360b4ab.mp3","entryId":"87330","definition":"使模样或规模等变得比原来更大。","pronunciation":["확때"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f75d2664aecb37c8","term":"거실","zh":"客厅","audio":"/audio/f75d2664aecb37c813ca.mp3","entryId":"66304","definition":"在西式房屋里，家人会聚或招待客人的主要空间。","pronunciation":["거실"]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"挂","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"为了使物体不掉落，吊挂在某处。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f32e58e89da29366494.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.552,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87330","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3787,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这张照片里全家人都拍得很好呢。","那我们就把照片放大，挂在客厅里吧。","喂，我是敏俊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这张照片里全家人都拍得很好呢。","那我们就把照片放大，挂在客厅里吧。","喂，我是敏俊。"],"answer":1}]}
